{
    "title": "Village City Life Building",
    "description": "This game is a building game, which simulates the real world and provides players with limitless resources to design their own city. You will be transformed into a multiplayer and create your own city with massive square castles, island or even with house and square house in gameworld.\r\nWhen participating in world construction, simulated in the real world, you can design special structures under square graphics in the tropical jungle, or explore the vast desert with seasonal changes of nature, including rain cycles, grass growth, and real life, animals and even mountains,...\r\nWith construction games, you can create a city with huge buildings, you need to be familiar with cubes. There are hundreds of different types of cube, From huge cube world, each with its own characteristics and uses, requiring your exploration and discovery.\r\nDo not underestimate these simple squares, if you arrange minicube skillfully, a dream city and world will gradually take shape. From gardens, houses, boats, cottages, villas to square castles. As long as you dare to imagine, your dream house and city can become a reality. Let\u2019s adventure, simulate and build your city now.\r\nCube's world will be even more exciting when you have your own 2D graphics pets, called lucky pets. Work hard, earn money and buy yourself the most powerful pets to make your city become more lively. They will help you go far, go fast, even fly around the world. The game has many places for exploration and adventure, simulating the real world.\r\nDon't just focus on building games, practice other skills with survival multiplayer mode: run away from giant monsters, traps and fight other players to survive. This will be a great opportunity to improve your aiming and moving skills.\r\nA secret to winning every battle is to use weapons to target your opponent's blind spot, with an example behind. Defense is equally important, equip yourself with state-of-the-art armor. Regularly upgrading your armor will also increase your chances of winning. As long as you practice hard, your mobility, ability to use weapons and reflexes will improve, now you can even destroy multiple opponents at the same time.\r\nThis game also provides players with many other interesting mini games, making your world more attractive than ever. Each minigame is a difficult challenge with hideous monsters, requiring ingenuity and quickness.\r\nJoin to build your world and become the master.",
    "descriptionHTML": "This game is a building game, which simulates the real world and provides players with limitless resources to design their own city. You will be transformed into a multiplayer and create your own city with massive square castles, island or even with house and square house in gameworld.<br>When participating in world construction, simulated in the real world, you can design special structures under square graphics in the tropical jungle, or explore the vast desert with seasonal changes of nature, including rain cycles, grass growth, and real life, animals and even mountains,...<br>With construction games, you can create a city with huge buildings, you need to be familiar with cubes. There are hundreds of different types of cube, From huge cube world, each with its own characteristics and uses, requiring your exploration and discovery.<br>Do not underestimate these simple squares, if you arrange minicube skillfully, a dream city and world will gradually take shape. From gardens, houses, boats, cottages, villas to square castles. As long as you dare to imagine, your dream house and city can become a reality. Let\u2019s adventure, simulate and build your city now.<br>Cube&#39;s world will be even more exciting when you have your own 2D graphics pets, called lucky pets. Work hard, earn money and buy yourself the most powerful pets to make your city become more lively. They will help you go far, go fast, even fly around the world. The game has many places for exploration and adventure, simulating the real world.<br>Don&#39;t just focus on building games, practice other skills with survival multiplayer mode: run away from giant monsters, traps and fight other players to survive. This will be a great opportunity to improve your aiming and moving skills.<br>A secret to winning every battle is to use weapons to target your opponent&#39;s blind spot, with an example behind. Defense is equally important, equip yourself with state-of-the-art armor. Regularly upgrading your armor will also increase your chances of winning. As long as you practice hard, your mobility, ability to use weapons and reflexes will improve, now you can even destroy multiple opponents at the same time.<br>This game also provides players with many other interesting mini games, making your world more attractive than ever. Each minigame is a difficult challenge with hideous monsters, requiring ingenuity and quickness.<br>Join to build your world and become the master.",
